# Projective resolution
%%%
tag := "Chapter8/Definition8.2.1"
number := false
%%%

*Definition 8.2.1.* A *projective resolution* of $`M` is an exact sequence

$$`\cdots \to P_2 \to P_1 \to P_0 \to M \to 0`

such that all modules $`P_i`, $`i \geq 0`, are projective.
